  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Champion's Choice Duo is a premium natural-gut and polyester hybrid combining Wilson Natural Gut 16 / 1.30 mm with Luxilon ALU Power Rough 17 / 1.25 mm. Wilson identifies this combination as Roger Federer's string choice, with Natural Gut installed in the mains and ALU Power Rough in the crosses for a softer feel, exceptional pocketing and superb playability. Players seeking more durability can reverse the configuration and install ALU Power Rough in the mains. The hybrid combines the power, elasticity and touch of natural gut with the spin, control and durability of textured performance polyester.",

    "zh": "Wilson Champion's Choice Duo 是一套高端 Natural Gut + Polyester 官方 Hybrid，由 Wilson Natural Gut 16 / 1.30 毫米与 Luxilon ALU Power Rough 17 / 1.25 毫米组成。Wilson 将其称为 Roger Federer 的球线选择：Natural Gut 放在主线、ALU Power Rough 放在横线，以获得更加柔和的手感、优秀的 Ball Pocketing、力量以及非常高的 Playability。如果球员更重视耐久，则可以把 ALU Power Rough 放在主线。整体上，这套 Hybrid 将天然肠线的弹性、力量、舒适和 Touch，与 ALU Power Rough 的 Spin、Control、Snapback 和 Durability 结合，是典型的专业级 Natural Gut / Polyester Hybrid。"
  },

